{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you can play the opening portion of <i>Type Ride</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save data and progress from the demo will not carry over to the upcoming Early Access version or the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Type Ride&quot;</strong> is a typing-based tower defense game where you summon units by typing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, once known as the &quot;Type Rider&quot; for her high-speed typing skills while riding a motorcycle, has been tasked with resolving issues in a world overrun by ink lifeforms. She decides to ride her beloved bike once again.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Unique Deck</strong>: Construct your own deck with ink monsters, each possessing various elements such as attributes, classes, and special skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typing Summons</strong>: A system where you summon ink monsters by successfully typing. Counter the approaching ink lifeforms by summoning your own creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Battles</strong>: Use the order of summoning and spell cards strategically to gain an advantage in battle.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035550?t=1759302364","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035550?t=1759302364","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035550/a6efc46cb26c43294f7c367bd30f8ffd3c79a22e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759302364","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035550/a6efc46cb26c43294f7c367bd30f8ffd3c79a22e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759302364","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you can play the opening portion of <i>Type Ride</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save data and progress from the demo will not carry over to the upcoming Early Access version or the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Type Ride&quot;</strong> is a typing-based tower defense game where you summon units by typing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, once known as the &quot;Type Rider&quot; for her high-speed typing skills while riding a motorcycle, has been tasked with resolving issues in a world overrun by ink lifeforms. She decides to ride her beloved bike once again.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Unique Deck</strong>: Construct your own deck with ink monsters, each possessing various elements such as attributes, classes, and special skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typing Summons</strong>: A system where you summon ink monsters by successfully typing. Counter the approaching ink lifeforms by summoning your own creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Battles</strong>: Use the order of summoning and spell cards strategically to gain an advantage in battle.</p></li></ul>","developers":["NOT__OK\u2019\u2019"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3295430","name":"Type Ride"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035550/a3d616f7676e05ebfdb960bd6fed29487f8e3f2f/header.jpg?t=1759302364","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><u